@.str.165 = private unnamed_addr constant [905 x i8] c"Function to simplify mesh using Quadric Error Metric Decimation by Garland and Heckbert.\0A\0AThis function always uses the CPU device.\0A\0AArgs:\0A    target_reduction (float): The factor of triangles to delete, i.e., setting\0A        this to 0.9 will return a mesh with about 10% of the original triangle\0A        count. It is not guaranteed that the target reduction factor will be\0A        reached.\0A\0A    preserve_volume (bool): If set to True this enables volume preservation\0A        which reduces the error in triangle normal direction.\0A\0AReturns:\0A    Simplified TriangleMesh.\0A\0AExample:\0A    This shows how to simplify the Stanford Bunny mesh::\0A\0A        bunny = o3d.data.BunnyMesh()\0A        mesh = o3d.t.geometry.TriangleMesh.from_legacy(o3d.io.read_triangle_mesh(bunny.path))\0A        simplified = mesh.simplify_quadric_decimation(0.99)\0A        o3d.visualization.draw([{'name': 'bunny', 'geometry': simplified}])\0A\00", align 1
